# The LÖVE the game is built and tested against. Single source of truth: conf.lua,
# build/*.ps1, the CI workflow and the docs read it or point here. To move to a newer
# LÖVE, see "Moving to a newer LÖVE" in docs/BUILD.md.
#
# love            MAJOR.MINOR that conf.lua declares (t.version); must match the runtime
# love_commit     love2d/love commit whose CI artifacts are the desktop build (build/get-love.ps1)
# love_android_commit  love2d/love-android commit the APK is built from (build/build-android.ps1).
#                 love-android carries its own copy of LÖVE as a submodule, and moves it on its own
#                 schedule: at this pin it bundles love2d/love 792690b (2026-07-24), which is 34
#                 commits OLDER than love_commit. The build prints the bundled commit every time.
#
# THE ONE EXCEPTION TO "LÖVE 12": the browser build.
# web_love        love.js has no LÖVE 12 port (upstream stops at 11.5), so the browser build runs
#                 an 11.x runtime. build/build-web.ps1 packages the game with ITS OWN copy of this
#                 file declaring love=<web_love>, so conf.lua states what that runtime really is.
#                 Nothing else in the repo is on 11.x. Drop this when a LÖVE 12 web port exists.
# lovejs_commit   Davidobot/love.js commit the web build installs (never its moving default branch)
